OL,4,BHampshire bowler Currie signs new deal 
OL,5,Bto 2029                                
OL,6,GHampshire pace bowler Scott Currie has 
OL,7,Gsigned a new deal at the club that     
OL,8,Gwill extend his stay through until     
OL,9,G2029.                                  
OL,11,FThe 25-year-old right-armer has been   
OL,12,Fthe Hawks' leading T20 Blast wicket    
OL,13,Ftaker across the past two seasons,     
OL,14,Fwith his haul of 26 in the summer the  
OL,15,Fsecond highest in this year's          
OL,16,Fcompetition.                           
OL,18,FHe also took 12 wickets in six County  
OL,19,FChampionship matches, six years on     
OL,20,Ffrom making his debut at the Utilita   
OL,21,FBowl in the summer of 2020.            
